's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"b4a520a0bec76441871aec7010e2c596","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"fa8d2f0389c9b6920fa58534535b4a81","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"4220d6cf20282506b53fb1ccfd6ab56f","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"248b93d56fba03dc309c2bb935558796","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"540d5535db0607eb4d76a27925b7d463","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"8a8a14815824045a8164ee70a74b2c8d","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"7a927547d5b6780fe87cd258f18057ba","originalFileName":"c2e32e39-b977-4fec-8916-740621382145-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"23051fc38d474b4f4092497ecc4eaba5","